# Screenshot Checklist: Cisco Security Lab

Capture these from your own lab, save them in this folder using the file names below, and tick each box.
Hide or blur real public IPs, serial numbers, license keys, and passwords before committing.

- [ ] `01-topology.png` : Packet Tracer/GNS3 topology
- [ ] `02-vlan-brief.png` : show vlan brief
- [ ] `03-trunk.png` : show interfaces trunk
- [ ] `04-acl-hits.png` : show access-lists with hit counts
- [ ] `05-port-security-violation.png` : err-disabled port
- [ ] `06-ssh-only.png` : Telnet refused, SSH works
- [ ] `07-ospf-auth.png` : OSPF neighbor with authentication
